          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <header>
      <div class="header-text">
        <h1>David Laganière, ing., P.Eng.</h1>
        <h2>Software Engineer</h2>
      </div>
      <img src="/photo.webp" class="photo" alt="Illustration of David Laganière" loading="eager" sizes="150px" />
    </header>
    <main>
      <p class="about">
        Hi, I'm David! I'm a software engineer with nearly two decades in telecommunications. I'm currently focused on platform reliability, observability, and full-stack development. I care very much about security, user experience, maintainability, and the kind of code that doesn't come back to haunt you six months later.<br>
        <br>
        I work across the full stack and across the full lifecycle — from containerization and infrastructure automation to frontend design and observability. I'm drawn to problems that require deep domain knowledge and ingenious solutions, and I'm passionate about best practices, high standards, and high work quality.
      </p>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
